    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "idk, paths out of this... everything feels so permanent. like the debt, the expectations, the mistakes... its not just a bad week. its my whole life. it feels like the only way to actually stop the noise is to just... cease. does that even make sense? or am i just being dramatic?",
